                <mxCell id="A8" parent="laneA" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Design notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Init only lists files. Opening/decoding them is check_decode&#39;s job (next step).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• An existing manifest wins: files added to or removed from datadir later are not reconciled, yet __len__/__getitem__ use self.paths, so the two can disagree.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every row gets its own UUID group_id; group() later merges duplicates into shared ids.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The audit log gets an entry only when the manifest is created, not when it is read." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="330" width="240" x="10" y="1000" as="geometry"/>
